  teaser   = {157 genes across 14 oscillatory signaling pathways classified into rise-phase and recovery-phase by temporal role only. Rise genes enriched for oncogenes, recovery for tumor suppressors (OR = 27.5, p = 3.6 × 10⁻⁹); 12/12 pathways match the prediction. Predicted inversions in growth-inhibitory pathways (p53, TGF-β) confirmed. On 22 divergent cases, the temporal framework is correct in 19/22 (86%) vs 3/22 (14%) for naive biochemical classification.},
